{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1755724628"}, "name":{"label":"aydaleeadrenaline"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-14T16:04:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12311673531"}, "title":{"label":"Extremely Useful 🤩"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a very helpful app if you want to stay scheduled and organised every day. I absolutely would recommend using this as a day planner if you want to go to work, take a stroll, go shopping or anything else. This app allows you to structure your day and make everything so much easier. \n\nMy wish: I wish we didn’t have to pay to go pro and change a few things. But either way, it’s still awesome! And again, yes I would definitely suggest this! 👌", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1738296235"}, "name":{"label":"Ezzzziieee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-05T23:20:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12276729582"}, "title":{"label":"Good app, pro is the problem"}, "content":{"label":"I think that this app allows enough freedom with not paying for a subscription for the pro version, but if I want an app like this I want it all to be more accessible, I don’t want to pay to be able for the app to nudge me to take a shorter shower. Kind of a waste, I understand trying to make more money with your app but isn’t it just having it in the App Store enough? Not hating, this app is amazing I love the lay out and everything it’s nice on my eyes and I love the fact that you have a font for dyslexic people it’s very smart and the fact you don’t have to get pro for it is great too, thankyou for being accessible for everyone. I also love the logos to change the app. Overall, great app. Thank you for reading!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
