{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1499091806"}, "name":{"label":"tyson046"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-18T19:11:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.2"}, "id":{"label":"11849416904"}, "title":{"label":"The Scheduling Powerhouse"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app - it’s perfect for scheduling and planning. Thank you Structured team! It feels very easy and the base app is fully useful and functional without the pro subscription. It works great across a iPhone and MacBook.\n\nMy only criticism is that the time scrollers (to set duration of an event) feel quite clunky. They’re designed so that the event stays a specified length but it feels very fiddly to change an event to your desired time. Maybe instead of these ‘smart scrollers’ that move on their own, the app could use regular scrollers for an easier user experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
